put',fire:'wealth',earth:'power',metal:'resource'},strength:{water:'peak',wood:'weak',fire:'trap',earth:'dead',metal:'strong'}})};e.elements=Y;e.twelveStagesData=[{number:3,name:'growth',visual:'\u2605\u2605',rating:2,strength:11,chinese:'\u957f\u751f',desc:'As the first (or third, depending on interpretation) phase of the life cycle, this indicates an exception level of honesty, intelligence, and wholeness.  Excellence in creativity will help advance careers.  However, it is said that leadership position should be delayed until a later stage.'},{number:4,name:'bath',visual:'\u2715\u2715',rating:-2,strength:4,chinese:'\u6c90\u6d74',desc:'The Bath phase indicates capricious nature, with one often bouncing from one idea to the next, resulting in volatile friendship and career changes.  At the same time, one is plagued with a stubborn sense of self which can cause conflicts in relationships.'},{number:5,name:'youth',visual:'\u2605',rating:1,strength:9,chinese:'\u51a0\u5e26',desc:'The beginning of the ascent. One sees potential on the horizon and will thrive to achieve success.  Stubborness persists as the climb continues.'},{number:6,name:'thriving',visual:'\u2605',rating:1,strength:10,chinese:'\u4e34\u5b98',desc:'A positive phase -- one will stand with honor and sincerity.  Independence and authority will be sought-after as desires come through.'},{number:7,name:'peak',visual:'\u2605\u2605',rating:2,strength:12,chinese:'\u5e1d\u65fa',desc:'A phase with the strongest, confident energy.  A most auspicious phase, one will be proud and attention seeking, perhaps overly competitive.'},{number:8,name:'aging',visual:'\u2014',rating:0,strength:8,chinese:'\u8870',desc:'As climax has been reached, this is a neutral phase as one maintains stabiility and restrained impulsiveness.  Modesty and acceptance overrides aspirations.'},{number:9,name:'sickness',visual:'\u2014',rating:0,strength:6,chinese:'\u75c5',desc:'The energy of body and mind are beginning decline. Social skills are refined as one is understanding of his or her place in the universe.'},{number:10,name:'death',visual:'\u2715',rating:-1,strength:3,chinese:'\u6b7b',desc:'One will be hesitant on important decisions and dwell on trivial matters.  Energy is on decline, and most find it difficult to stay in long term relationships.'},{number:11,name:'grave',visual:'\u2715\u2715',rating:-2,strength:2,chinese:'\u5893',desc:'One will become a closed shell who prefers to collect memories and linger on the past.  Difficult to open to change and societal fluctuations.  Correlated to introvertedness.'},{number:12,name:'extinct',visual:'\u2715\u2715',rating:-2,strength:1,chinese:'\u7edd',desc:'Also known as the last stage before "reborn", this phase contains the weakest energy of all twelve stages.  Enthusiasm is at its lowest, and the soul is ready to begin anew.'},{number:1,name:'conceived',visual:'\u2014',rating:0,strength:5,chinese:'\u80ce',desc:'The womb is where it all begins.  A spark of curiosity and peculiarity light up the spirit.  Life becomes a playground, leading to a satisfying level of humbleness and humor.'},{number:2,name:'nourishing',visual:'\u2014',rating:0,strength:7,chinese:'\u517b',desc:'At this phase, one is content.  As the last (or second, depending on interpretation) phase of the life cycle, one will carefully seek opportunities to develop.'}];var j=c.Ordinals.seasons;e.seasons=j;var k={jia:y({$icon:{source:l.color.stems.jia}},c.Ordinals.stems.jia,{natureName:'tree',elementName:'yang wood',chinese:'\u7532',pinyin:'jia',name:'jia',element:'wood',polarity:'yang',direction:'E',season:'spring',spirit:'green dragon',trigram:'zhen',number:0,symbols:'first, creative, growth, strong, unyielding, firm, direct, rooted, ambitious, thick, powerful',body:'gallbladder, head, thyroid, nervous system, scapula, ankle, fingernails, toenails',clashes:['geng','wu'],combine:'ji',combineResult:'earth',twelveStages:['hai','zi','chou','yin','mao','chen','si','wu','wei','shen','you','xu'],as