act others.'},bloodBlade:{$dict_noun:['mishaps','injuries','accidents','cuts'],ref:'yearBranchAux',name:'bloodBlade',chinese:'\u8840\u5203',icon:'needle',isDefaultSelected:!0,rating:0,desc:'Prone to accidents, mishaps, falls, cuts, surgeries.'},skyDipper:{$dict_noun:['nature','order','alignment'],ref:'yearBranchAux',name:'skyDipper',chinese:'\u5929\u7f61',icon:'material-ui',isDefaultSelected:!0,rating:1,desc:'One is aligned with the natural order of things.'},yearPenalty:{$dict_noun:['uncertainty','impediments','outcome'],ref:'yearBranchAux',name:'yearPenalty',chinese:'\u6b72\u5211',icon:'wall',isDefaultSelected:!0,rating:0,desc:'Uncertain outcomes, possible impediments.'},yearBreaker:{$dict_noun:['spendthrift','wealth'],ref:'yearBranchAux',name:'yearBreaker',chinese:'\u6b72\u7834',icon:'pillar',isDefaultSelected:!0,rating:0,desc:'Money comes, money goes.  Finds it hard to save money.'},disasterSha:{$dict_noun:['accidents','problems','conflicts'],ref:'yearBranchAux',name:'disasterSha',chinese:'\u6b73\u715e',icon:'hazard-lights',isDefaultSelected:!0,rating:0,desc:'Accidents, problems, and conflicts.'},calamitySha:{$dict_noun:['injuries','illness','problems'],ref:'yearBranchAux',name:'calamitySha',chinese:'\u707d\u715e',icon:'meteor',isDefaultSelected:!0,rating:0,desc:'Prone to bodily injuries, minor illness.'},sickness:{$dict_noun:['worry','anxiety','illness'],ref:'yearBranchAux',name:'sickness',chinese:'\u75c5\u7b26',icon:'pill',isDefaultSelected:!0,rating:0,desc:'Prone to illness, worry, anxiety. Should take care of health and visit hospitals less often.'},fortuneVirtue:{$dict_noun:['positivity','protection','ethics','behavior'],ref:'yearBranchAux',name:'fortuneVirtue',chinese:'\u798f\u5fb7',icon:'cash-100',isDefaultSelected:!0,rating:1,desc:'Positivity and protection from the upper realm. Ethical and proper behavior.'},whiteTiger:{$dict_noun:['legal','volatility','uncertainty','catalyst','collision'],ref:'yearBranchAux',name:'whiteTiger',chinese:'\u767d\u864e',ico